{"no":1,"title":"A Private Conversation","titleZh":"私人谈话","audio":"L01.mp3","duration":76.24,"question":{"en":"Why did the writer complain to the people behind him?","zh":"作者为什么向坐在他身后的人抱怨？"},"sentences":[{"i":0,"t":12.81,"t2":20.63,"en":"Why did the writer complain to the people behind him?","zh":"作者为什么向坐在他身后的人抱怨？","meta":true},{"i":1,"t":20.63,"t2":24.14,"en":"Last week I went to the theatre.","zh":"上星期我去看戏。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"week went","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"PP","x":"to the theatre","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"NP","x":"the theatre","g":"冠词+名"}],"pat":"主谓","gp":["一般过去时","主谓句型"]},{"i":2,"t":24.14,"t2":27.47,"en":"I had a very good seat.","zh":"我的座位很好。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"had seat","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"ADJP","x":"very good","g":"形容词短语"},{"c":"NP","x":"a very good seat","g":"形容词修饰名词"}],"pat":"主谓宾","gp":["一般过去时","主谓宾句型"]},{"i":3,"t":27.47,"t2":30.66,"en":"The play was very interesting.","zh":"戏很有意思。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"was interesting","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"ADJP","x":"very interesting","g":"形容词短语"},{"c":"NP","x":"The play","g":"冠词+名"}],"pat":"主系表","gp":["一般过去时","主系表句型"]},{"i":4,"t":30.66,"t2":33.49,"en":"I did not enjoy it.","zh":"但我却无法欣赏。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"did not enjoy it","g":"动词短语"}],"pat":"主谓宾","gp":["否定的 not","主谓宾句型"]},{"i":5,"t":33.49,"t2":38.25,"en":"A young man and a young woman were sitting behind me.","zh":"一青年男子与一青年女子坐在我的身后。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"were sitting","g":"进行时态谓语"},{"c":"PP","x":"behind me","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"NP","x":"A young man","g":"冠词+形+名"},{"c":"NP","x":"a young woman","g":"冠词+形+名"}],"pat":"主谓","gp":["一般过去时","主谓句型","并列结构"]},{"i":6,"t":38.25,"t2":40.72,"en":"They were talking loudly.","zh":"他们正在大声地说着话。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"were talking loudly","g":"进行时态谓语"}],"pat":"主谓+状语","gp":["一般过去时","主谓+状语句型"]},{"i":7,"t":40.72,"t2":43.39,"en":"I got very angry.","zh":"我非常生气。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"got angry","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"ADJP","x":"very angry","g":"形容词短语"}],"pat":"主谓","gp":["一般过去时","主谓句型"]},{"i":8,"t":43.39,"t2":46.53,"en":